{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Last Signal is a retro-futuristic sci-fi narrative adventure game. Follow Simon Scott and his five crewmates aboard the USS Resonance on a critical mission to deflect a planet-killer asteroid heading for Earth. With a ten-year journey, divided into five years out and five years back, a lot can happen...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>An Immersive Atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Last Signal</i> offers a stunning audiovisual experience. The meticulously crafted environment reflects a true passion for science fiction and storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzles and Mini-Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a variety of puzzles and mini-games designed to enrich your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shadows, Lights, Sounds and Optimizations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Last Signal features incredible 3D sound and visual ambiance with impeccable optimization. A lot of work has gone into these aspects to offer you the best possible experience, allowing you to fully immerse yourself in a science fiction story with a totally unexpected ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Interaction with the Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move, inspect and analyze every detail of the ship to uncover its secrets and progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Examine Objects and Discover Hidden Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on objects that catches your eye. Examine them from every angle and pay attention! You could find hidden notes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Remember Simon's Past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simon\u2019s memories are fading. Collect them as you journey through the game. At the end of each level, a fragment of his past resurfaces, revealing echoes of a painful story\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mars: This Little Guy is More Than Just a Cat to Simon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mars is always by Simon\u2019s side. But why? How? This curious and agile companion may hold the key to unlocking secrets and hidden passages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pay Attention to Simon's Heartbeat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darkness is not just a backdrop, it weighs on Simon\u2019s mind. Stay in the shadows too long, and things will get harder. A word of advice: don\u2019t linger in the dark\u2026 and use your flashlight wisely.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2906180?t=1744224700","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744224700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906180/3f006b16c5b92b9308107891952c387ff55eae75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744224700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906180/3f006b16c5b92b9308107891952c387ff55eae75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744224700","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Last Signal is a retro-futuristic sci-fi narrative adventure game. Follow Simon Scott and his five crewmates aboard the USS Resonance on a critical mission to deflect a planet-killer asteroid heading for Earth. With a ten-year journey, divided into five years out and five years back, a lot can happen...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>An Immersive Atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Last Signal</i> offers a stunning audiovisual experience. The meticulously crafted environment reflects a true passion for science fiction and storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzles and Mini-Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a variety of puzzles and mini-games designed to enrich your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shadows, Lights, Sounds and Optimizations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Last Signal features incredible 3D sound and visual ambiance with impeccable optimization. A lot of work has gone into these aspects to offer you the best possible experience, allowing you to fully immerse yourself in a science fiction story with a totally unexpected ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Interaction with the Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move, inspect and analyze every detail of the ship to uncover its secrets and progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Examine Objects and Discover Hidden Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on objects that catches your eye. Examine them from every angle and pay attention! You could find hidden notes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Remember Simon's Past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simon\u2019s memories are fading. Collect them as you journey through the game. At the end of each level, a fragment of his past resurfaces, revealing echoes of a painful story\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mars: This Little Guy is More Than Just a Cat to Simon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mars is always by Simon\u2019s side. But why? How? This curious and agile companion may hold the key to unlocking secrets and hidden passages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pay Attention to Simon's Heartbeat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darkness is not just a backdrop, it weighs on Simon\u2019s mind. Stay in the shadows too long, and things will get harder. A word of advice: don\u2019t linger in the dark\u2026 and use your flashlight wisely.</p>","developers":["Scratched Metal"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906180/header.jpg?t=1744224700","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Last Signal","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970, 4 GB | AMD Radeon R9 380, 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Scratched Metal"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906180/1b886bdcf6cd5a39f457443a71d08d717851e926/ss_1b886bdcf6cd5a39f457443a71d08d717851e926.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744224700","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906180/1b886bdcf6cd5a39f457443a71d08d717851e926/ss_1b886bdcf6cd5a39f457443a71d08d717851e926.600x338.jpg?t=1744224700"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https:/